Package: phtourismrecovery
Title: Has Philippine Tourism Recovered? Forecasting Visitor Arrivals After COVID-19
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Reproducible targets pipeline and Quarto dashboard that model the
    COVID-19 structural break in monthly Philippine visitor arrivals
    (Department of Tourism, 2010 onward) and forecast when arrivals pass
    their 2019 level. This file only lists dependencies; the project is not
    an R package.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
